sequenceDiagram
autonumber
actor Browser as Web browser
participant API as API service
participant Publisher as RabbitMqAlertPublisherAdapter
participant RabbitMQ as RabbitMQ exchange/queue
participant Consumer as RabbitMqClimateAlertConsumerAdapter
participant NotificationService
participant Profiles as MongoNotificationProfileRepository
participant Composite as CompositeAlertNotifierAdapter
participant InApp as InAppAlertNotifierAdapter
participant Notifications as MongoNotificationRepository
participant Events as EventEmitter2
participant Stream as NotificationStreamController

Browser->>Stream: GET /notifications/stream?token=JWT
Stream->>Stream: Verify JWT and bind connection to userId
Browser->>API: POST /measurements
API->>API: Measurement.create(..., alertSettings)
API->>Publisher: publishClimateAlert(ClimateAlertDetectedMessage)
Publisher->>RabbitMQ: publish exchange/routing key
RabbitMQ-->>Consumer: ClimateAlertDetectedMessage
Consumer->>NotificationService: handleClimateAlert(message)
NotificationService->>Profiles: findSubscribersByStationId(stationId)
Profiles-->>NotificationService: UserNotificationProfile[]
NotificationService->>NotificationService: Filter subscribers by station and alert type
NotificationService->>NotificationService: Resolve delivery targets, including deliveryChannels.inApp
NotificationService->>Composite: sendMeasurementAlert(notification)
Composite->>InApp: sendMeasurementAlert(notification)
InApp->>Notifications: save(Notification)
Notifications-->>InApp: Persisted or ignored duplicate userId+messageId
InApp->>Events: emit notification.delivered(userId, notification)
Events-->>Stream: notification.delivered for connected userId
Stream-->>Browser: event: notification + NotificationResponseDto JSON
Stream-->>Browser: event: ping every 25s
Browser->>Stream: reconnect after network loss
Browser->>Stream: GET /notifications/stream?token=JWT
Browser->>Stream: Rehydrate separately with GET /notifications
